---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import { cities, stats } from '../lib/data';

const liveCities = cities.filter((c) => c.slug).map((c) => c.name);
---
<Base
  title="About ApnaTutor — Local Tutor Marketplace in Pakistan | ApnaTutor"
  description="ApnaTutor Pakistan ke chhote sheheron ke liye banaya gaya tutor marketplace hai. Verified profiles, area-level search, aur parents ke liye bilkul free."
  path="/about"
>
  <Prose
    title="ApnaTutor ke baare mein"
    lead="Ek chhoti si koshish: apne ilaqay ka theek tutor dhoondna itna mushkil nahi hona chahiye."
  >
    <section>
      <h2>Masla kya hai</h2>
      <p>Pakistan ke chhote sheheron aur cantonment areas mein tutor dhoondne ka tareeqa abhi bhi wahi hai — kisi se poochna, Facebook group mein post karna, ya school ke bahar poster dekhna. Na koi tareeqa hai ye jaanne ka ke banda waqai wo parhata hai jo kehta hai, na fee ka andaza, na ye pata ke wo aapke mohalle tak aayega ya nahi.</p>
      <p>Baray shehron ke liye kuch platforms hain, magar wo Risalpur, Nowshera jaise ilaqon ko cover nahi karte — jahan zarurat shayad zyada hai.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Hum kya karte hain</h2>
      <p>ApnaTutor parents ko apne area ke tutors se milata hai. Har tutor ki profile par qualification, tajurba, subjects, classes, fee range, availability aur wo verification checks likhe hote hain jo humne khud kiye hain.</p>
      <p>Parents ke liye ye bilkul free hai, aur rahega. Hum tuition fee par koi commission nahi lete — fee parent seedha tutor ko deta hai.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Hum kis cheez par zyada sakht hain</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Jo verify nahi hua, us par badge nahi.</strong> Koi bikne wala "trusted" badge nahi hai.</li>
        <li><strong>Jhoote numbers nahi.</strong> Agar aapke area mein 4 tutors hain to site "4" hi likhegi. Koi "500+ tutors" jaisa dawa nahi.</li>
        <li><strong>Jhoote reviews nahi.</strong> Review sirf wahi parent likh sakta hai jisne us tutor ka contact khola ho, aur har review pehle hum dekhte hain.</li>
        <li><strong>Shanakhti documents hum store nahi karte.</strong> Dekhte hain, check karte hain, delete kar dete hain.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Abhi kahan tak hain</h2>
      {stats.tutorCount > 0 ? (
        <p>Is waqt <strong>{stats.tutorCount} approved tutors</strong> hain
          {stats.cityCount > 0 && <> aur <strong>{`${stats.cityCount} ${stats.cityCount === 1 ? 'city' : 'cities'}`}</strong> cover hoti hain</>}.
          Hum jaan boojh kar dheere barh rahe hain — har tutor ki verification khud karte hain, aur ye kaam automate nahi hota.</p>
      ) : (
        <p>Hum abhi shuruaat mein hain — pehle tutors onboard aur verify ho rahe hain. Jab tak aapke area mein tutors na aayein, aap apni requirement post kar sakte hain; hum aapko bata denge.</p>
      )}
      {liveCities.length > 0 && <p>Cities: {liveCities.join(', ')}.</p>}
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Rabta</h2>
      <p>Koi mashwara, shikayat ya sawal ho to <a href="/contact">contact page</a> par likhein.</p>
    </section>
  </Prose>
</Base>
